# Spot source

This package holds three Spot tools: ltlsynt, autfilt and ltlfilt. They
come from Spot version @TAU_SPOT_VERSION@.

Spot is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3
(GPLv3). The license text is in the file COPYING in this folder. Tau runs
these tools as separate programs. Tau does not link Spot.

The source of these tools is in the same GitHub release as this package:

- `spot-@TAU_SPOT_VERSION@.tar.gz` is the Spot source release.
- `spot-build-scripts-@TAU_SPOT_VERSION@.tar.gz` holds the scripts that
  build the tools from that source.

The Spot source release is also at @TAU_SPOT_URL@.
The Spot home page is https://spot.lre.epita.fr/.
